+        // Aurora: never show this badge.
+        //
+        // It is a hardcoded red "LIVE" chip the library stamps over the top-left
+        // of the picture whenever ExoPlayer classifies the window as live. Every
+        // transcoded Aurora stream qualifies: the server writes HLS with
+        // -hls_playlist_type event, so the playlist carries no #EXT-X-ENDLIST
+        // until ffmpeg finishes the file, and ExoPlayer reads a dynamic window as
+        // live. The content is an ordinary seekable movie, not a broadcast.
+        //
